# Electron 二进制默认从 GitHub Releases 下载，国内网络经常超时或极慢。
# 改用 npmmirror 镜像；普通 npm 包仍走默认 registry。
electron_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/
# electron-builder 打包工具链（winCodeSign / NSIS / nsis-resources 等）同样走 npmmirror，
# 否则会从 GitHub 下载，国内经常超时失败。
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron-builder-binaries/
